.TB "Best Fit"
.P
Fullwidth U+FF21 best-fits to
.BR A ,
\(lq\[u221E]\(rq to
.B 8
in CP1252, and CP437 has \(lq\[u221E]\(rq at 0xEC, so even
.B strict
